OL,3,GNEWSATwo killed in crash between cars
OL,4,Aand lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been killed in a crash
OL,7,Finvolving two cars and a lorry in
OL,8,FHerefordshire.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Fcrash involving a Vauxhall Astra, a
OL,12,FCitroen C3 Picasso and a DAF lorry on
OL,13,Fthe A49 in Dinmore, at about 16:10 BST
OL,14,Fon Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe Vauxhall's driver, a man in his
OL,17,F40s, and a passenger, a man in his 20s,
OL,18,Fdied at the scene, West Mercia Police
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
